<title>NETHERLANDS: EOE members vote for Amsterdam exchange merger.</title>
<headline>EOE members vote for Amsterdam exchange merger.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Over 90 percent of the members of the European Options Exchange (EOE) voted last night in favour of a planned merger with the Amsterdam Stock Exchange, the EOE said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The proposal was accepted by the meeting of members of the association (EOE) with more than 90 percent of the votes and 80 percent of all members present.&quot;</p>
<p>A final decision on the merger will be taken next week when Amsterdam Stock Exchange members vote on the proposal.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
